theorem `denseRange_zsmul_iff` / 定理 `denseRange_zsmul_iff`

English:
theorem denseRange_zsmul_iff
  given: {p : Real} [Fact (0 < p)] {a : AddCircle p}
  proof: by
  rcases QuotientAddGroup.mk_surjective a with ⟨a, rfl⟩
  simp [denseRange_zsmul_coe_iff, isOfFinAddOrder_iff_exists_rat_eq_div, Irrational]

